or guidance is needed beyond the label.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It should remain short, clear and scannable, helping the user to understand what happened and what he can do next.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"bulletList","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional list of bullet points, each one raw, localized or rich, to be displayed in the alert message following the label or the optional "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"link","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional link to be displayed in the alert message. It can be used to trigger an action.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"disableVoiceOverAnnouncement","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Disables the automatic VoiceOver announcement of the alert message when it appears. Default is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"name":"onClose","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional callback invoked when the close button is clicked. If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", the close button is not displayed and the alert message","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remains visible until the context changes (e.g., the issue is resolved, the screen is refreshed). Otherwise, the alert message is dismissable and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"includes a close button, allowing the user to dismiss it when he has acknowledged the message.  Some alerts must remain visible to ensure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user is aware of important information; others can be closed to reduce visual clutter.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View\/disabled(